software/study_runner/integrations/brainbit/logs/
software/study_runner/integrations/brainbit/recordings/
software/study_runner/integrations/**/logs/
software/study_runner/integrations/**/*.log
software/logs/
# DeepFace runtime cache and separately licensed operator-provisioned weights.
